{
 "about": "Made-up cpp config (account.py, emit.py, gen_data.py) for a small 2D game whose matched units live in src_matched/GAME: every key once, with invented names, files and addresses. A real project's config has the same shape, only longer. Paths are relative to the project folder; regexes match whole names.",
 "module": "GAME",
 "units": "src_matched/GAME",
